WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.901 size:81% position:41%
-Guys, this weekend is
Daylight Savings Time

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:05.872
which means we all get to sleep
in an extra hour on Sunday.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:07.807 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:08.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:11.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
