microwave.

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
Should I press Start?
I already pressed Clock.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.852 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I pressed Clock!

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.255
And this is fun, Sunday is also
the New York City Marathon.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.458 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
